	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"Figure-rise Standard セル(完全体)がパッケージをリニューアルして登場！！",
			"• セルVS悟飯の対決を再現！",
			"• かめはめ波（溜め・放出）のエフェクトパーツも付属。",
			"• パーツ裏打ちでセルの特徴的な模様を再現！細密な設計と造形によりキャラクターの肉体を自然な造形で再現。",
			"• 強靭な筋肉パーツを組み合わせることで、ドラゴンボールのキャラクターの鍛え抜かれた肉体を自分の手で作り上げることができる、新たなプラモデル構築システムだ!!"
		],
		"en": [
			"Figure-rise Standard cell (complete) is now available with a renewed package! !",
			"• Recreate the showdown between Cell and Gohan!",
			"• Kamehameha (storage/release) effect parts are also included.",
			"• Reproduce the characteristic cell pattern with parts lining! The character's body is reproduced in a natural shape through detailed design and modeling.",
			"• A new plastic model construction system that allows you to create the well-trained body of a Dragon Ball character with your own hands by combining strong muscle parts!!"
		]
